 <body>
  <table class="contentpageDefaultEmailTemplatePageTemplate" style="background-color: #E9EAEC;" role="presentation" id="contentpage_emailTemplateBodyContent" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td width="100%" align="center">
      <table class="contentRoot" style="background-color: #FFFFFF;" role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
       <tbody>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;">
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td align="Center"><img src="{[devName:Screenshot_20260924_at_91619AM]}" alt="" width="600" style="width: 100%; display: block; border: none; max-width: 100%; object-fit: fill;" /></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;">Dear {{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_First_Name__c}}} {{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_Last_Name__c}}},</span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"><strong>Thank you for applying to Zeta Charter Schools!</strong> We are so excited that you are considering Zeta for </span></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000;">{{{IndividualApplication.fxApplicant_First_Name__c}}}</span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">, and we look forward to being with you through the next steps of the process.</span></span></span></span></span><br /><br /><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Log in </span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/s/login/SelfRegister" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="color:#9361a8;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">here</span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><font color="#1155cc">&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">to view your application.</span></span></span></span></span><br /><br /><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">At Zeta Middle Schools, we believe these years are where independence takes root. This is where students build confidence, self-discovery, and a drive to challenge themselves. Our classrooms are rigorous, supportive, and personalized—teachers know their students and push them to take ownership of their academics and their day. It is the foundation for our high school, where students take advanced courses and are prepared for college and life. Our middle schoolers are among the top academic achievers in New York State and NYC and consistently score above state averages. </span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="66.66%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <div class="columnDiv" style="margin-right: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;">
               <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
                <tbody>
                 <tr>
                  <td>
                   <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                    <tbody>
                     <tr>
                      <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-bottom:8px"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Zeta students benefit from:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
                       <ul>
                        <li style="list-style-type: disc;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">A </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">strong academic foundation</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> that prepares them for long-term success</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
                        <li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">A school culture grounded in </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">care, belonging, and </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">high expectations</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
                        <li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Thoughtful partnership with families every step of the way</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
                        <li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">A </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">tuition-free public charter education </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">open to all students</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
                       </ul><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">As Zeta’s Enrollment Team, we will be your main point of contact moving forward. We will share updates, key dates, and opportunities to learn more about our school community, and are always here if you have any questions.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td>
                     </tr>
