                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta, our enrollment team is here for you every step of the way:</em><br /> ✉️<em>&nbsp;</em><a href="mailto: enroll@zetaschools.org"><span style="color:#0054a6;">enroll@zetaschools.org</span></a><br /><em>📞 </em><a href="tel: 646-480-1654"><span style="color:#0054a6;">(646) 480-1654</span></a></span><br /> &nbsp;</td>
